# EdgePay Worker secrets — example file.
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development (`wrangler dev` auto-loads it).
# In production set these values via `wrangler secret put <NAME>` or via the
# Deploy to Cloudflare button setup page.
#
# Deploy to Cloudflare button: only the 5 real secrets below are prompted as
# secure masked fields (•). All 8 harmless variables (ENABLED_GATEWAYS,
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS, CF_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN, CF_ACCESS_AUD_TAG, BREAK_GLASS_CLIENT_ID,
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID, CF_ZONE_ID, PBKDF2_ITERATIONS) are defined in wrangler.jsonc "vars"
# as normal text inputs with default values.
#
# Generate the 3 required secrets before deploying:
#   JWT_SECRET:      openssl rand -hex 32
#   APP_KEY:         openssl rand -base64 32
#   ENCRYPTION_KEY:  openssl rand -base64 32

# --- REQUIRED secrets (stay masked •) --------------------------------------

# Signs mobile-companion JWTs (HS256). Min 32 chars.
JWT_SECRET=

# HMAC key for signing operations (base64-encoded 32 bytes).
APP_KEY=

# AES-256-GCM key for at-rest encryption (base64-encoded 32 bytes).
ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# --- OPTIONAL secrets (configure after deploy via Dashboard / wrangler secret put)
#
# Emergency service token secret paired with non-secret BREAK_GLASS_CLIENT_ID:
# BREAK_GLASS_CLIENT_SECRET=
#
# Cloudflare API token for custom hostnames (Cloudflare for SaaS):
# CF_API_TOKEN=
